      "japan-quake",
      "curiosity"
    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Government rescues, AIG bonuses and debt ratings drew scrutiny. Charities struggled, while companies still launched new products.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "The starting point mattered greatly. These results begin after earlier crisis losses; they do not undo what an investor who bought much earlier had lost.",
    "what_faded_away": "A rescue headline did not promise gains for existing shareholders. Nor did a critic’s view of an electronic reader settle its company’s future.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "The timing and strength of recovery were unknown. Large gains on a finished chart can hide the fear and sharp swings along the way.",
